<title>USA: Palm Beach County, Fla., bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Palm Beach County, Fla., bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>PALM BEACH COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $26,300,000</p>
<p>PARKS AND RECREATION FACILITIES</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc.</p>
<p>Howard Gary &amp; Company</p>
<p>Merchant Capital Corp.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
